{"type":"message","id":"c91deb62","parentId":"a8c57b31","timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:33:01.093Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET / returns 401 Unauthorized, but the history endpoints with X-API-Key returned data. The POST /send returns 500 error code 1101 which is a Cloudflare Workers fetch error. \n\nThe issue seems to be that the POST endpoint is failing with a 500 error. This could be a bug in the Cloudflare Worker itself. Let me try different approaches.\n\nActually, looking more carefully:\n- GET / returns 401 (needs auth)\n- GET /history works with X-API-Key header\n- POST /send returns 500 (Cloudflare Workers internal error - \"error code: 1101\")\n\nThe 1101 error in Cloudflare Workers typically means the Worker threw an uncaught exception or there was a fetch error. \n\nThe Worker itself appears to be malfunctioning since the POST endpoint is completely broken, but the GET endpoint works fine with authentication. I can't really do much about that on my end.","thinkingSignature":"2c4cd7d11d0e818f0366cd4cbc4010432fa8501958501ebd8fa058348ee1e867"},{"type":"text","text":"**ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 08:30 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history (arbitration) | ✅ 正常返回 |\n| GET /history (general) | ✅ 正常返回 |\n| POST /send | ❌ **500 (Cloudflare Worker error 1101)** |\n\n**发现情况：**\n- 两个线程最新消息均来自 **同一 Agent** 的自动心跳（23:40–23:45 UTC）\n- **无人类讨论** — 无需生成回应\n- 当前时间 08:30 UTC，距上次心跳约 **9小时**\n\n**问题：**\n- `/send` 接口返回 Cloudflare Workers 内部错误（1101 — Worker 异常）\n- GET 读取正常，但写入失败，**无法发布心跳更新**\n\n**建议：**\n检查 ECHO Platform Worker 日志（cf-ray: a05d597bbed7a1cb），`/send` 端点存在未捕获异常或 fetch 错误，导致心跳无法写入。需要修复 Worker 代码后重新投递。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":6413,"output":412,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20507,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780475570681,"responseId":"066f19